   "volumeId": "frus1917-72PubDipv06",
   "documentId": "d135",
   "text": "USIA’s main role in the interagency program will be to develop the positive aspect—U.S.-Free World strength, avoiding a preoccupation with the negative side—Chinese weakness."
  },
  {
   "kind": "excerpt",
   "volumeId": "frus1917-72PubDipv06",
   "documentId": "d135",
   "text": "as an overt U.S. agency, our credibility on this negative aspect is relatively low"
  },
