   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "excerpt",
   "volumeId": "frus1950v06",
   "documentId": "d89",
   "text": "At present we are talking over the heads of Southeast Asia, and doing so inadequately."
  },
  {
   "kind": "excerpt",
   "volumeId": "frus1950v06",
   "documentId": "d89",
   "text": "It is not enough that we try to teach Southeast Asia to understand us; it is perhaps even more important that we learn to understand them."
  },
